    "overrides": "firebase-admin -> jwks-rsa does require('jose'), but jose@6 is ESM-only (no CommonJS require export) and crashes with ERR_REQUIRE_ESM on Vercel's Node runtime. Pin jose to v5, which ships a CommonJS build. jwks-rsa only uses importJWK/exportSPKI, unchanged between v5 and v6."
